  "title": "Think Subtraction First",
  "description": "When solving a problem: - Ask yourself: \"Can something be removed to improve the situation?\" - List things to subtract: Write down what’s unnecessary before adding anything new. - Challenge 'more is better': Think, \"Less might actually be more effective.\" Example: Instead of adding more rules to improve a process, consider removing outdated or redundant ones.",
